# A workspace's .gitignore (F-51), at the workspace root beside presmium.workspace.yaml; a repository of
# one document has it too (npm create presmium@latest writes it to both). What is generated or installed
# stays out of the history and out of an agent's review; what belongs to a document stays in.
node_modules
dist/
# Deck working directories: only these files of .presmium/ belong to a document (recordings, drawings,
# assets, synthesized speech and the locks); the rest there is generated.
**/.presmium/*
!**/.presmium/freeze/
!**/.presmium/anchors.lock.json
!**/.presmium/drawings/
!**/.presmium/assets/
!**/.presmium/speech/
!**/.presmium/speech.lock.json
